                                "sense_id": "a129902b-03c9-32dd-af6c-85b96ffa10cb",
                                "text": "So I put my hand into the hat and presto! Out comes a rabbit!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "232c5efc-03c8-4e98-9915-337d13c78288",
                                "sense_id": "a129902b-03c9-32dd-af6c-85b96ffa10cb",
                                "text": "You know the old man's ivory leg, well I dreamed he kicked me with it ; and when I tried to kick back, upon my soul, my little man, I kicked my leg right off! And then, presto! Ahab seemed a pyramid, and I, like a blazing fool, kept kicking at it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
